(text "SIDEEYE / SERVO + ToF WIRING" (at 43.18 22.86 0) (effects (font (size 2.54 2.54)) (justify left top)) (uuid "56575d8f-21ac-4346-8752-9853f7ebcec5"))
(text "CONTROLLER: USB POWER" (at 111.76 50.8 0) (effects (font (size 1.524 1.524)) (justify left top)) (uuid "c1c7d1dd-9f36-4aa8-8eec-cea67c3c9e10"))
(text "WIRING NOTES" (at 43.18 137.16 0) (effects (font (size 1.524 1.524)) (justify left top)) (uuid "a92943ee-4f29-4464-bbff-ec0a8bd662b1"))
(text "1. U1 = XIAO ESP32-S3. J6 = Grove Vision AI V2 socket interface to Himax WiseEye2 HX6538.\n2. Fit a selective interposer / wire adapter: pass ONLY M1 pins 7, 8, 13, 14 to Grove.\n   Isolate M1 pins 1-6 and 9-12, especially D3 (Grove RESET) and 3V3 (separate regulators).\n   D0-D5 connect to peripherals on the XIAO side. This drawing requires that isolation.\n3. Sole power input: U1 USB-C. U1 pin 14 supplies +5V_USB to both servos and Grove M1.14.\n   U1 pin 12 supplies +3V3 to both ToF modules. All grounds common; PWM/UART logic is 3.3 V.\n   Verify USB source, cable and XIAO VBUS path for BOTH servo stall currents plus all electronics.\n   Check 3V3 regulator headroom for both sensors; use short servo power returns and local decoupling.\n4. D4/D5 form one shared I2C bus for J3/J4. Ensure SDA/SCL pullups to 3V3 on the modules;\n   account for parallel pullups. Start at 400 kHz. J1-J4 show signal names, not connector pin order.\n5. At boot drive both LPn low; raise sensor 1 LPn, set address to 0x2A, then raise sensor 2 (0x29).\n   Addresses above are 7-bit; ST API may use 0x54 / 0x52. Repeat after power loss.\n6. Use 3.3 V-compatible VL53L7CX modules with I2C_RST held low and INT unused (polling).\n   D6 TX -> WE2 PB6 RX; D7 RX <- WE2 PB7 TX. Select UART in the Grove firmware/host driver." (at 43.18 142.24 0) (effects (font (size 1.016 1.016)) (justify left top)) (uuid "30896ecd-4a75-4605-9a22-274def4558c9"))
(text "D0 / GPIO1 = servo 1 PWM\nD1 / GPIO2 = servo 2 PWM\nD2 / GPIO3 = sensor 1 LPn\nD3 / GPIO4 = sensor 2 LPn\nD4 / GPIO5 = shared SDA\nD5 / GPIO6 = shared SCL\nD6 / GPIO43 = UART TX to WE2\nD7 / GPIO44 = UART RX from WE2" (at 200.66 113.03 0) (effects (font (size 1.016 1.016)) (justify left top)) (uuid "350a70c6-350c-4a48-a4a9-76d273365678"))
(symbol (lib_id "SideEye_Wiring:Grove_Vision_AI_V2_UART") (at 142.24 27.94 0) (unit 1) (in_bom yes) (on_board no) (dnp no) (uuid "3d241503-8a43-4725-a9e7-4111a08b260f") (property "Reference" "J6" (at 163.83 22.86 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)))) (property "Value" "GROVE VISION AI V2 / UART" (at 163.83 25.4 0) (effects (font (size 1.016 1.016)))) (instances (project "sideeye" (path "/f5c2a4d7-5a15-4583-b1e5-94f0d73ba681" (reference "J6") (unit 1)))))
